{"title":"2025 WSMO Accuracy Round Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_WSMO_Accuracy_Round_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/9/d59e6b371eb2a3206d9ec376adadd2beb3c34f64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f:\\{1,2,\\dots,20\\} \\to \\{1,2,\\dots,20\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"262\" height=\"20\" /> be a function such that for all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/2/5c27fb46cb4fb2915e95133d1ca99356e8667416.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m,n \\in \\{1,2,\\dots, 20\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"162\" height=\"20\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/5/ed50f56dee7b1b790a7fa12651ed28f92641161e.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\gcd(m,f(n)) = \\gcd(n,f(m)).\\]\" width=\"229\" height=\"18\" /> How many such functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> are there?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_WSMO_Accuracy_Round_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018033612\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.006 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 25/1000000\nPost‐expand include siz